      "t": "2026-11-21T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "BBC News reports that Mayor Zohran Mamdani has announced a plan to close New York's Rikers Island jail by 2032.",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:3df0760b00a4",
        "wiki:rev:1387042473:17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-21T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "In November 2026, the plan pushed back the closing of the facility to 2032, replacing it with four smaller borough prisons in the Bronx, Queens, Brooklyn and Manhattan, plus medical facilities for certain inmates.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387042473:17"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-21T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Rikers Island is a 413 acre prison island in the East River in the Bronx that contains New York City's largest jail.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1387042473:0"
      ]
    },
    {
